  "content": "\n\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TeJCIjl.png\" alt=\"Formations Nether 橫幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"797\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Formations Nether</strong>&nbsp;為地獄增添了大量新結構！</h3>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5g5Tv1t.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h4><strong>結構</strong></h4>\n<h5>以下是你可以在 Formations Nether 中找到的部分結構範例。如需更多圖片，請瀏覽圖庫。</h5>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/728/310/172/small_fire_arena.png\" alt=\"充滿凋靈敵人的致命競技場\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/729/310/172/nether_wart_field.png\" alt=\"地獄疣田\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/739/310/172/blackstone_remnant.png\" alt=\"黑石結構殘跡\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/731/310/172/large_house.png\" alt=\"隱藏於绯紅森林中的小屋\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/eBJO3ce.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h4><strong>常見問題</strong></h4>\n<h5><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用你的模組嗎？</strong></h5>\n<h5>可以，歡迎將我的模組用於您的整合包中。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PXuubVS.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Discord</strong></h4>\n<h5>欲了解未來更新、即將推出的模組及參與討論，歡迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 伺服器！</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"Discord 加入按鈕\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PaZVj5S.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/L7py1j1.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DAvtJUL.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>",
